hl.intro.1=§8[???]§r §7This world is not as empty as it looks. Every day you stay, something else notices you're here.
hl.intro.2=§8[???]§r §7Read the §fJournal§7. Craft a §fFlashlight§7 and §fBatteries§7. A §fWard Lantern§7 keeps your home safe... mostly.
hl.act.n=Act %s
hl.act.1.name=Visitors
hl.act.1.intro=§8[???]§r §7You're alone in this world. Aren't you?
hl.act.1.text=First, sounds that aren't there: footsteps, doors, your name.\n\nThen the visitors come. §fHerobrineGamer788§r joins your game. Underground, the §fCave Dweller§r stalks you. §fChests§r turn up where there were none. And somewhere there's a §fstatue§r with its face in its hands that wasn't there yesterday.\n\nFar down, under the deepslate, there is an §3Ancient City§r. Something lives there. It listens.
hl.act.2.name=The Woods
hl.act.2.intro=§8[???]§r §7Don't go into the woods at night.
hl.act.2.text=§fHerobrine§r watches you with his tail of vertebrae. Something screams like a goat between the trees. The §ffog§r rolls in. A cow looks at you with human eyes. A §fman in a hat§r gets into your house. Something pale crouches in a field and watches you. Someone knocks on your door with your voice. You find §fyour own grave§r. And in the water, something takes you by the ankle.
hl.act.3.name=The Error
hl.act.3.intro=§8[???]§r §7Something has broken in the code. And something very tall is coming.
hl.act.3.text=§fnull§r corrupts the world. §fEntity 303§r joins your game and plays with it. A siren wails far away, and something taller than the trees carries it instead of a head. In the snow, something listens to you breathe.\n\nEvery four days, the §4Red Night§r.\n\nIf you have found all seven pages, you know how to end this.
