hl.lore.visit=§lThe Visit§r\n\nAt night, at home, three knocks on the door. Then a voice in the chat, with your name: "Open up. It's me. It's cold out here."\n\nOpen it and there is nobody, only the wind. A moment later someone thanks you for letting them in, right behind you. Don't open it, and it keeps knocking, louder and louder. It tries the handle. And then, silence.\n\n§eTip:§r don't open it. And if you already have, don't turn around.
hl.arrive.visit=§8[???]§r §7If someone knocks at night, don't open. You're already inside.
hl.visit.1=Open up. It's me. It's cold out here.
